# Outfit camera (R18): a chunky instant camera in the accent colour, glowing stripe across the face, big steel lens,
# signal-yellow flash (a thing the player uses) and a fresh print sticking out of the top.
name outfit_instantcam
grid 5
size 5 6 7
slot body SwatchAccent
slot stripe SwatchGlow
slot lens Steel
slot flash Signal
slot print Paint
box 0 0 0 4 6 5 body
paint box 3 0 3 4 6 4 stripe
beam 4 3 2 5 3 2 1.5 lens
box 1 4 4 3 6 5 flash
box 1 1 5 2 5 7 print
pivot 2 3 0
